      "created_at": "2018-12-05T15:53:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Figured we could use somewhere to discuss and ask questions about the 'Urban Infestation' one-shot.</p>\n<p>I haven't had the chance to run it yet, but it makes good reading. I think it was a pretty neat story, and it was cool to see the new RPG versions of Dark Watch. I especially like Setback and Expat's new designs(I'm loving the long hair on Amanda).</p>\n<p>Miriad is pretty cool too. I kind of want to see if I couldn't somehow design a hero along the same story/powers and abilities as him/it. Not the last 'Chaos' ability of course, but the others he has listed seem like they could work...</p>\n<p>A question I had when I was reading through his character sheet though. For boosting his health vs the number of heroes, if I had three players then I should boost his normally 26 HP to 41, correct?</p>",
